WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.447
Hi, friends. Gani here. This is Different, Not Less.

00:00:12.447 --> 00:00:16.894
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:16.894 --> 00:00:19.562
Hands resting on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:19.562 --> 00:00:22.230
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:29.344
People do things in different ways. That is just how people are.

00:00:29.344 --> 00:00:37.349
Some of us learn by looking. Some by doing. Some by listening.

00:00:37.349 --> 00:00:44.463
Some of us talk with words. Some talk with signs, or pictures, or a device that helps.

00:00:44.463 --> 00:00:47.131
And bodies are different too — fast, slow, rolling, resting. Every way is a way.

00:00:47.131 --> 00:00:54.246
Here is the important part. Different is a word that describes. It never ranks.

00:00:54.246 --> 00:01:00.472
Different never means less. Not for anyone. Not ever.

00:01:00.472 --> 00:01:07.586
Nobody here is more. Nobody here is less. We are different, and we are equals.

00:01:07.586 --> 00:01:13.812
You never have to explain your way of doing things. Nobody does.

00:01:13.812 --> 00:01:19.148
Nobody needs pity. Pity looks down. Respect stands side by side.

00:01:19.148 --> 00:01:26.263
In this class, we work side by side. Your way and my way both belong here.

00:01:26.263 --> 00:01:34.267
If someone's way is new to you, you can watch, and learn, and let it be theirs.

00:01:34.267 --> 00:01:39.603
You don't have to understand a way to respect it.

00:01:39.603 --> 00:01:42.271
Same classroom. Same team. Different ways.

00:01:42.271 --> 00:01:48.497
Different is a description. Equals is what we are.

00:01:48.497 --> 00:01:52.943
Shoulders soft. Let your body rest.

00:01:52.943 --> 00:01:56.501
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:01:56.501 --> 00:02:00.947
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:02:00.947 --> 00:02:05.394
You're ready for what's next.
